	tests/benchmark/benchmark_log_v3.csv = Linux x86_64 benchmark history with real-binary provenance and wall/CPU/RSS metrics
	tests/benchmark/corpus.bash = deterministic synthetic corpus and immutable real ELF pair validation
	tests/benchmark/results.bash = v2/v3 benchmark schemas and normalized regression calculations
	tests/benchmark/test_bm.bash = fail-closed generator, real-ELF, resource-metric, history, and claim contracts
	tests/cli/test_cli.bash = File/tree CLI integration suite with independent recursive byte and metadata comparisons
	tests/codec_rust = QA-only Rusty_zstd compatibility package; production remains zstdz and other Rust candidates are source-reviewed only
