	tests/ffi/test_installed_lib.bash = Links and round-trips tests/ffi/caller.c against only installed header+archive
	tests/ffi/test_rust_lib.bash = Build target-matched Debug libdifz.a and verify a Rust executable links and runs without dynamic difz/zstd/PCRE2 libraries
